.TH FERDIM-GUI 1 "2026-10-21" "ferdim 1.3.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ferdim-gui \- GTK 4 front-end for the FerDim download manager
.SH DESCRIPTION
Desktop application showing the FerDim download queue with per-job controls
and a maximum-power toggle. Talks to the
.BR ferdim (1)
daemon over its local socket and starts it on demand. Requires
python3-gobject.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ferdim (1)
